{"articleNo":"41300","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=41300&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2012학년도 1학기 근로장학생 선발 및 유의사항 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2012.03.01","hit":"8420","attachments":[{"name":"부서별 전화번호.xls","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=41300&attachNo=1403"},{"name":"국가근로장학금 출근부 및 시간표 입력 메뉴얼.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=41300&attachNo=1404"},{"name":"부서별 근로장학생 선발 명단.xls","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=41300&attachNo=1441"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">2012학년도 1학기 근로장학생 선발 및 유의사항 안내</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">1. 근로기간 : 2012. 3. 2(금) ~ 6. 22(금)</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">2. 국가근로장학생은 시간표 입력, 출근부 입력을 숙지하기 바랍니다.[붙임3]</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 시간표 입력기간 : 2012. 3. 2(금) ~ 3. 15(목)</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 출근부 입력 : <u><font color=\"#0900ff\">근로 후 5일 이내 입력가능</font></u>(5일 이내 미입력시 입력 불가하오니 주의바람)</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 한국장학재단 홈페이지 로그인 후 출근부 입력가능</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">3. 대학근로장학생은 원스톱서비스 - 근무상황부 작성하시기 바랍니다.</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">4. </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">유의사항</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\"> : <font color=\"#0900ff\">학적변동자(<u>휴학, 제적 </u>등)일 경우 근로 불가능</font>(재학생만 근로가능)</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;* 휴학신청일부터 근로 불가능(장학금 지급제외)</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">5. 문의 : 478-7065</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\"><br></span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">붙임&nbsp; 1. 부서별 근로장학생 선발 명단 1부.</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 2. 부서별 전화번호 1부.</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;3. 국가근로장학생 시간표 및 출근부 입력방법 1부.&nbsp; 끝.</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\"><br></span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\"><br></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\"><br></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">2012. 3. 1.</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">학&nbsp;&nbsp; 생&nbsp;&nbsp; 처</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
